WEBVTT

02:21.880 --> 02:25.000
Mr. Yang, Ms. Ji, it's time to wake up.

02:25.520 --> 02:27.080
All right. Please don't come in now.

02:28.920 --> 02:30.480
Wait a moment!

02:32.880 --> 02:34.640
Don't come in!

02:41.680 --> 02:43.040
Without our permission,

02:43.560 --> 02:44.560
they won't be allowed in.

02:48.280 --> 02:49.120
Come in.

02:54.120 --> 02:55.000
I am Jinxiu, your servant.

02:55.080 --> 02:57.200
Greetings to Mr. Yang and Ms. Ji.

02:57.920 --> 02:58.960
Madam told me

02:59.040 --> 03:00.800
to bring these maids

03:00.880 --> 03:02.760
to serve in your place.

03:02.840 --> 03:05.520
We await your orders, Mr. Yang and Ms. Ji.

03:12.600 --> 03:15.320
Yingying. Yingying.

03:21.960 --> 03:22.800
Rise.

03:22.880 --> 03:25.120
Thank you, Mr. Yang, and Ms. Ji.

04:12.600 --> 04:14.200
Our Yang family has many strict rules.

04:14.280 --> 04:16.640
It may take some time for you to adapt.

04:17.440 --> 04:18.839
But don't worry.

04:18.920 --> 04:20.079
As long as I'm here,

04:20.160 --> 04:21.640
no one will dare to bully you.

04:23.800 --> 04:24.640
For now,

04:24.720 --> 04:27.720
the most important thing
is to rescue your mother.

04:29.720 --> 04:31.720
Thank you, Yang Jinglan.

04:35.360 --> 04:36.360
No need to thank me.

04:38.520 --> 04:39.880
We have plenty of time ahead.

04:49.800 --> 04:50.640
Look at all this blood.

04:50.720 --> 04:52.720
It's soaked into the planks.

04:52.800 --> 04:55.000
If I don't replace them,

04:55.080 --> 04:56.640
no one will dare to take my boat.

04:57.160 --> 04:58.440
Such bad luck!

05:02.440 --> 05:03.920
Enough. Stop complaining.

05:04.000 --> 05:04.840
Here.

05:08.960 --> 05:10.520
Is that enough to replace the planks?

05:11.680 --> 05:12.560
It's more than enough!

05:13.480 --> 05:14.680
Could you tell us exactly

05:14.760 --> 05:16.120
what happened that day?

05:18.720 --> 05:21.240
A man should build a family and career,
but where's your career now?

05:21.320 --> 05:23.720
You're a grown man.
Don't you feel any shame?

05:28.640 --> 05:30.760
Boatman, when will we dock?

05:30.840 --> 05:31.880
Soon.

05:31.960 --> 05:33.960
Why don't you stay in the cabin
and rest a little longer?

05:36.000 --> 05:38.080
Those two women are too noisy.
I came out for some fresh air.

05:43.480 --> 05:44.640
Whatever.

05:44.720 --> 05:45.640
We're almost there.

05:45.720 --> 05:47.200
- I'll go check on them.
- Okay.

05:51.400 --> 05:54.000
Murder!

05:58.160 --> 06:00.080
She killed my wife!
Quick, report to the authorities!

06:00.680 --> 06:03.040
So, you didn't see my mother kill her
with your own eyes?

06:03.720 --> 06:05.880
What does it matter
if I saw it personally or not?

06:06.680 --> 06:08.680
There were only two people in the cabin.

06:08.760 --> 06:10.080
If your mother hadn't killed her,

06:10.160 --> 06:11.880
who else could have done it? A ghost?

06:44.680 --> 06:46.480
Do you usually light incense on your boat?

06:46.560 --> 06:47.920
Yes.

06:48.000 --> 06:49.240
It keeps mosquitoes away.

06:49.320 --> 06:51.720
But that's strange

06:51.800 --> 06:54.280
because since they boarded my boat,

06:54.360 --> 06:55.400
the incense burner has disappeared.

06:56.720 --> 06:58.280
It's truly odd.

06:59.400 --> 07:01.960
CASE REPORT

07:04.000 --> 07:05.520
The wound on her neck

07:05.600 --> 07:07.320
is the only fatal wound.

07:07.920 --> 07:09.680
Here. This is the murder weapon.

07:13.360 --> 07:15.240
It is indeed my mother's hairpin.

07:17.160 --> 07:18.240
And over here.

07:18.320 --> 07:20.360
These outer garments
belong to your mother,

07:20.440 --> 07:22.160
your aunt, and Li Feng.

07:26.200 --> 07:27.520
They're stored as evidence

07:28.200 --> 07:30.280
because of the bloodstains.

08:05.440 --> 08:06.680
Do you notice anything unusual?

08:07.800 --> 08:09.640
The stains on these two garments
aren't blood.

08:09.720 --> 08:10.680
They're dye.

08:10.760 --> 08:11.880
Dye?

08:17.280 --> 08:18.920
I know what was going on now.

08:21.200 --> 08:22.920
This case is actually very simple.

08:23.440 --> 08:25.160
It's just that the county magistrate
refuses to investigate.

08:31.600 --> 08:32.960
The victim's husband, Li Feng,

08:33.640 --> 08:36.720
and the boatman, Yu San, both testified

08:36.799 --> 08:38.000
that on the day of the incident,

08:38.080 --> 08:41.080
Mrs. Li and Mrs. Ji argued on the boat.

08:41.679 --> 08:43.760
As the boat was about to dock,

08:43.840 --> 08:45.320
the two men entered the cabin

08:45.400 --> 08:46.720
and found the victim

08:46.800 --> 08:49.120
stabbed to death
with a hairpin by Mrs. Ji.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.640
The evidence and testimony are conclusive.

08:51.720 --> 08:52.960
Ms. Ji,

08:53.600 --> 08:55.840
on what grounds
do you claim your mother was wronged?

08:55.920 --> 08:57.560
Speak truthfully to this court.

08:58.160 --> 08:59.640
I have three points of doubt, Your Honor.

08:59.720 --> 09:00.960
First,

09:01.560 --> 09:03.080
according to the boatman
Yu San's testimony,

09:03.160 --> 09:05.760
he did not see my mother
committing murder personally.

09:06.360 --> 09:09.920
Instead, he heard shouting after Li Feng
entered the cabin.

09:10.000 --> 09:12.240
Then, he saw my aunt covered in blood,

09:12.320 --> 09:13.520
lying in Li Feng's arms.

09:14.280 --> 09:15.760
Blocked by Li Feng,

09:15.840 --> 09:18.880
he might not have even seen
if my aunt had any wounds.

09:18.960 --> 09:21.040
The boat was in the middle of the river,
surrounded by no one.

09:21.120 --> 09:23.720
In that cabin,
it was only your mother and your aunt.

09:23.800 --> 09:25.400
If your mother hadn't killed her,
then who else could have done it?

09:25.480 --> 09:28.440
Why don't we suspect
the first person who found the victim?

09:29.200 --> 09:31.560
Li Feng and the boatman entered the cabin
one after the other,

09:31.640 --> 09:33.560
only moments apart.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.480
How could he have had time to kill?

09:35.560 --> 09:38.240
And why didn't the two women resist

09:38.320 --> 09:40.040
or make any noise?

09:41.320 --> 09:42.960
That's my second point of doubt.

09:43.040 --> 09:44.960
If my mother was the murderer,

09:45.040 --> 09:47.480
then why was she also found unconscious
on the boat?

09:48.240 --> 09:51.560
Perhaps your mother hit her head
while committing the murder

09:51.640 --> 09:52.840
and fainted.

09:52.920 --> 09:55.080
Or she was overcome by fear after the act

09:55.160 --> 09:56.960
and passed out.

09:57.040 --> 09:58.880
Those are possible scenarios,

09:58.960 --> 10:00.440
but there's another explanation.

10:01.040 --> 10:03.600
My mother was framed.

10:04.120 --> 10:06.320
Both she and my aunt
were drugged unconscious.

10:06.400 --> 10:08.680
Your claims are mere speculation,

10:09.440 --> 10:11.120
unsupported by evidence.

10:11.640 --> 10:12.960
I have proof, Your Honor.

10:13.480 --> 10:15.920
Please examine it.

10:22.760 --> 10:25.720
Here is the incense ash that I found
on Yu San's boat.

10:26.320 --> 10:28.360
I had it examined by a physician.

10:28.440 --> 10:29.760
It contains datura

10:29.840 --> 10:31.600
and other sleep-promoting herbs.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.080
If Your Honor don't believe me,

10:33.160 --> 10:35.440
you may have another physician verify it.

10:36.160 --> 10:38.320
You say you found it on the boat.

10:38.840 --> 10:40.760
How can you prove it was from the boat?

10:41.320 --> 10:42.200
Mr. Zhuge!

10:42.280 --> 10:43.480
Please make way.

10:50.680 --> 10:51.520
Your Honor,

10:52.440 --> 10:54.000
Inspector Yang is unwell

10:54.080 --> 10:56.160
and has tasked me and the Qianniu Guards

10:56.240 --> 10:57.800
with assisting Ms. Ji in this case.

10:58.600 --> 10:59.840
I can testify

11:00.440 --> 11:03.280
that this incense ash
was indeed discovered on Yu San's boat.

11:03.360 --> 11:04.720
This matter is unrelated
to the brocade industry,

11:04.800 --> 11:07.320
so there's no need for Inspector Yang
to be troubled.

11:07.400 --> 11:09.360
Your Honor, that's not accurate.

11:09.880 --> 11:11.400
The one suffering from this case

11:11.480 --> 11:12.720
is the president of the Bloom Society.

11:12.800 --> 11:14.480
How could it be unrelated
to brocade affairs?

11:15.160 --> 11:16.320
Still, Inspector Yang trusts

11:16.400 --> 11:18.960
that you will uncover the truth

11:19.040 --> 11:20.560
and has no intention of interfering.

11:21.200 --> 11:23.160
However, the murderer
committed the crime openly,

11:23.240 --> 11:24.560
showing great nerve.

11:24.640 --> 11:27.240
Surely, someone must be behind this.

11:27.760 --> 11:29.800
Inspector Yang sent me here

11:30.320 --> 11:31.920
to remind Ms. Ji

11:32.000 --> 11:33.920
that you also have allies on your back.

11:34.480 --> 11:35.440
There's no need to fear them.

11:38.320 --> 11:40.000
So what if it was found on the boat?

11:40.080 --> 11:41.000
How can you prove

11:41.080 --> 11:42.560
that it was the incense lit
by the boatman on that day

11:42.640 --> 11:45.320
and that your mother was drugged by it?

11:46.080 --> 11:47.760
That's right.

11:47.840 --> 11:49.000
How can you prove it?

11:49.560 --> 11:50.400
I can't prove it.

11:51.120 --> 11:53.000
If you can't prove it,
why bring it up at all?

11:55.200 --> 11:57.280
Nevertheless,
I have a third point of doubt.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.400
I ask Your Honor to allow me
to present it.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.240
If I don't allow you to continue,
will you really stop?

12:02.120 --> 12:03.160
These three outer garments

12:03.240 --> 12:06.200
belong to my mother, my aunt, and Li Feng,
who were wearing them respectively

12:06.280 --> 12:07.880
on the day of the incident.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.200
Your Honor, take a look.

12:09.280 --> 12:11.920
Do you notice any difference
in the bloodstains?

12:12.000 --> 12:14.040
What difference could there be?

12:14.120 --> 12:16.000
- I won't look at them.
- Fine.

12:16.080 --> 12:18.320
Then, let everyone else take a look.

12:18.840 --> 12:21.280
What's the difference in the bloodstains
on these garments?

12:31.240 --> 12:33.080
Why is the color on this one

12:33.160 --> 12:34.360
different from the others?

12:34.440 --> 12:36.520
Even the smell is not the same.

12:37.040 --> 12:39.800
The bloodstain on Mrs. Ji's garment
has a noticeably fainter smell.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.600
Because some of it is blood,

12:42.680 --> 12:44.800
and some of it is dye.

12:47.720 --> 12:49.440
Most of the stains

12:49.960 --> 12:51.440
on my mother's garment are dyes.

12:51.520 --> 12:53.040
Your family runs a dyehouse.

12:53.120 --> 12:55.120
It's not strange for your mother's garment

12:55.640 --> 12:56.600
to have dye on it.

12:56.680 --> 12:57.880
But my aunt does not work in a dyehouse.

12:57.960 --> 13:00.600
Why does her garment also have dye?

13:01.120 --> 13:02.600
And why does Li Feng's garment

13:02.680 --> 13:04.840
have only blood

13:04.920 --> 13:06.120
and no dye at all?

13:06.200 --> 13:07.040
Ji Yingying,

13:07.120 --> 13:09.040
even if your three points of doubt

13:09.120 --> 13:10.120
are true,

13:10.800 --> 13:13.360
they have nothing to do
with the truth of this case.

13:13.440 --> 13:14.280
Of course they do.

13:15.440 --> 13:17.840
These three points, when connected,
can prove

13:17.920 --> 13:20.040
that my mother is not the murderer.

13:20.120 --> 13:21.560
The true murderer

13:21.640 --> 13:22.480
is him,

13:22.560 --> 13:23.880
Li Feng!

13:23.960 --> 13:25.120
Utter nonsense!

13:27.080 --> 13:28.560
- IOU?
- From the very beginning,

13:28.640 --> 13:30.000
- Li Feng planned this entire scheme.
- How dare you bring that up?

13:30.080 --> 13:31.880
The argument in the cabin that day

13:31.960 --> 13:33.600
- was not between my mother and my aunt.
- I see it now.

13:33.680 --> 13:35.680
It was Li Feng
deliberately causing a scene

13:35.760 --> 13:37.800
- to make the boatman hear arguments.
- You…!

13:37.880 --> 13:39.200
- At the same time, he lit an incense stick
- You are twisting facts!

13:39.280 --> 13:40.600
in the cabin's corner.

13:40.680 --> 13:42.080
Then, he left under some excuse.

13:42.160 --> 13:43.560
Shortly after Li Feng left,

13:43.640 --> 13:45.600
my mother and aunt both fell unconscious.

13:46.440 --> 13:47.640
Outside the cabin,

13:47.720 --> 13:49.120
Li Feng deliberately engaged Yu San
in conversation.

13:49.200 --> 13:50.760
Soon. Why are you not getting

13:50.840 --> 13:52.360
- He told Yu San that it was
- some rest inside the boat's cabin?

13:52.440 --> 13:54.320
my mother and aunt
who were arguing in the cabin,

13:54.400 --> 13:56.760
creating a motive for my mother
to commit murder.

13:56.840 --> 13:59.000
When the boat was about to dock,

13:59.080 --> 14:01.200
he acted concerned and entered the cabin
to call for them.

14:01.280 --> 14:02.600
That was when

14:02.680 --> 14:04.440
he executed his tricks.

14:13.680 --> 14:15.320
After hastily finishing his act,

14:15.400 --> 14:16.960
he shouted loudly,
drawing Yu San into the cabin.

14:17.040 --> 14:18.080
Murder!

14:18.760 --> 14:20.520
By the time Yu San entered the cabin,

14:20.600 --> 14:21.760
he naturally assumed

14:21.840 --> 14:23.840
that my aunt was already dead

14:23.920 --> 14:27.000
and that the murderer was my mother,
who was holding the hairpin.

14:27.080 --> 14:29.480
Once there was finally someone to serve
as a witness for him,

14:29.560 --> 14:30.960
he struck the final blow

14:31.040 --> 14:32.480
and framed my mother for the crime.

14:33.080 --> 14:35.800
This is a total lie! Utterly absurd!

14:35.880 --> 14:37.120
Your Honor,

14:37.200 --> 14:38.440
she is falsely accusing me!

14:45.880 --> 14:47.080
Ms. Ji,

14:47.160 --> 14:50.080
your deductions are certainly intriguing.

14:50.600 --> 14:53.440
Unfortunately, besides the bloodstains
on the victim's clothes,

14:53.520 --> 14:55.840
there is no direct evidence

14:55.920 --> 14:58.480
to prove
that Li Feng committed the murder.

14:58.560 --> 14:59.480
Meanwhile,

14:59.560 --> 15:01.280
the evidence against your mother
is undeniable.

15:01.360 --> 15:04.080
I must still sentence your mother…

15:04.160 --> 15:05.720
Hold on, Magistrate Meng.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.560
Li Feng, can you guess

15:08.640 --> 15:11.200
why I'm so certain
that you are the murderer?

15:14.680 --> 15:16.280
I have another witness.

15:16.360 --> 15:18.160
He saw Li Feng commit murder
with his own eyes.

15:18.760 --> 15:19.800
A witness?

15:19.880 --> 15:22.080
I, humble citizen Yu San,
am willing to testify!

15:26.080 --> 15:27.760
Your Honor, I am guilty.

15:27.840 --> 15:30.600
I shouldn't have kept silent.

15:31.400 --> 15:32.920
That day on the boat,

15:33.000 --> 15:35.160
Li Feng asked me to report the case.

15:35.240 --> 15:37.600
I wanted to row away quickly,

15:37.680 --> 15:40.240
but I feared I'd be implicated later.

15:40.320 --> 15:42.960
So, I went to speak to Li Feng.

15:43.040 --> 15:45.240
Who would know the moment I entered,

15:45.760 --> 15:46.600
I saw

15:47.280 --> 15:50.080
he used the hairpin to kill his own wife!

15:50.160 --> 15:51.080
You're lying!

15:51.160 --> 15:52.440
There's both testimony
and physical evidence.

15:52.520 --> 15:53.440
What else do you have to say?

15:54.040 --> 15:55.200
Yu San,

15:55.280 --> 15:56.320
why didn't you say this earlier?

15:56.400 --> 15:58.520
Do you know giving false testimony
is also a crime?

16:06.320 --> 16:07.840
Your Honor, I just wanted

16:07.920 --> 16:10.000
to avoid unnecessary trouble.

16:10.080 --> 16:12.240
Besides, this case

16:12.760 --> 16:14.240
involves certain things…

16:14.320 --> 16:15.480
You know what I mean.

16:15.560 --> 16:17.880
How could I dare to speak out?

16:17.960 --> 16:20.360
- Impossible!
- If no one saw it,

16:20.440 --> 16:23.200
how could I deduce
to check the bloodstains on the clothes?

16:23.280 --> 16:25.920
How could I infer everything
so precisely without error?

16:26.000 --> 16:26.920
No way!

16:27.000 --> 16:29.560
When I did it, I clearly looked back.
There was no one, absolutely no one!

16:31.040 --> 16:32.960
- "Did it?"
- "Did it?"

16:34.480 --> 16:35.600
Magistrate Meng,

16:36.440 --> 16:37.280
he confessed.

16:37.360 --> 16:39.040
Ji Yingying, you tricked me!

16:39.120 --> 16:40.200
Compared to your schemes

16:40.280 --> 16:41.920
and heartless deeds, I fall far behind.

16:43.160 --> 16:45.240
Ji Yingying, how dare you!

16:45.760 --> 16:48.160
You colluded with the witness
and gave false testimony in court.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.080
What punishment do you deserve?

16:50.560 --> 16:52.760
The one who should be punished first

16:53.480 --> 16:54.880
is the murderer.

16:54.960 --> 16:57.160
Li Feng killed his wife.
His crimes are vile!

16:57.760 --> 16:59.120
Magistrate Meng,

16:59.640 --> 17:01.560
will you turn a blind eye
and a deaf ear to this?

17:01.640 --> 17:03.720
Will you turn a blind eye
and a deaf ear to this?

17:03.800 --> 17:04.960
Exactly!

17:09.800 --> 17:12.040
You can't wrong the innocent.
Punish the real criminal!

17:13.000 --> 17:14.680
Your Honor! Magistrate Meng!

17:14.760 --> 17:15.599
I had no choice.

17:15.680 --> 17:17.520
I was forced to do this.

17:18.760 --> 17:20.880
By whom?
Is that person present in this court?

17:20.960 --> 17:22.560
He was wearing black clothes.

17:22.640 --> 17:23.680
I didn't see his face clearly.

17:24.200 --> 17:26.079
But he said if I didn't obey,

17:26.160 --> 17:27.280
he would kill me!

17:27.880 --> 17:28.960
What bad luck!

17:29.040 --> 17:30.600
Just wait until I'm lucky at gambling.

17:30.680 --> 17:31.840
I'll win everything back from you!

17:33.640 --> 17:35.520
Mercy, my lord! Have mercy, my lord!

17:35.600 --> 17:36.840
Are you Li Feng?

17:38.040 --> 17:39.200
My lord, please have mercy!

17:39.280 --> 17:41.840
I swear I'll repay the debt.
If a man isn't dead, his debt isn't gone.

17:41.920 --> 17:43.880
If you kill me,
you won't get your money back either!

17:43.960 --> 17:45.760
I'm not here to collect debts.

17:45.840 --> 17:47.560
I'm here to help you repay them.

17:48.560 --> 17:50.000
Follow my plan,

17:50.080 --> 17:52.480
and I'll ensure your future is secure.

17:52.560 --> 17:54.040
If you don't obey,

17:54.120 --> 17:56.240
then, from now on,
you won't need to repay anything.

17:56.320 --> 17:58.000
- Do you understand?
- I understand!

17:58.080 --> 17:59.040
I understand.

17:59.680 --> 18:01.880
Follow orders and I get money.
Disobey and I lose my life.

18:09.000 --> 18:10.960
He has confessed everything.

18:11.040 --> 18:13.600
Please, Magistrate Meng,
deliver justice for the people.

18:14.320 --> 18:17.160
Deliver justice for the people!

18:17.240 --> 18:19.480
Deliver justice for the people!

18:19.560 --> 18:21.960
- Deliver justice for the people!
- Deliver justice for the people!

18:22.040 --> 18:23.600
- Deliver justice for the people!
- Deliver justice for the people!

18:23.680 --> 18:25.640
- Deliver justice for the people!
- Deliver justice for the people!

18:27.480 --> 18:28.800
What am I supposed to do now?

18:29.320 --> 18:31.640
On one side is the Crown Prince
and on the other is the General.

18:31.720 --> 18:34.480
I… I can't afford
to offend either of them.

18:36.080 --> 18:38.080
But the Zhao family head has already left.

18:38.160 --> 18:40.520
What's stopping you
from delivering a verdict now?

18:46.080 --> 18:46.920
How dare you, Li Feng!

18:47.000 --> 18:48.480
First, you slandered an innocent,

18:48.560 --> 18:50.480
and now you dare to deceive this court.

18:50.560 --> 18:51.920
Guards, seize him!

18:52.840 --> 18:53.960
Magistrate Meng! We had an agreement!

18:54.040 --> 18:55.200
- Silence!
- You can't do this, Magistrate Meng!

18:55.280 --> 18:57.360
We had a deal! Magistrate Meng!

19:00.240 --> 19:01.080
I hereby declare

19:01.160 --> 19:03.920
that Mrs. Ji is innocent
and is hereby acquitted.

19:04.920 --> 19:06.920
That's right.

19:07.000 --> 19:08.040
That's how it should be!

19:11.720 --> 19:14.080
As for giving false testimony in court,

19:14.760 --> 19:17.760
- Ms. Ji, you…
- Magistrate Meng's fair judgment

19:17.840 --> 19:19.800
is truly a blessing for the people

19:20.320 --> 19:21.760
and our good fortune.

19:21.840 --> 19:23.560
Magistrate Meng!

19:25.720 --> 19:28.040
Magistrate Meng,
you are indeed perceptive and just!

19:28.120 --> 19:29.320
When word of this spreads,

19:29.400 --> 19:31.360
it will surely become a celebrated tale!

19:31.440 --> 19:33.640
- A celebrated tale indeed!
- Exactly.

19:33.720 --> 19:36.880
If my father hears about today's case,

19:36.960 --> 19:39.040
he will surely praise Magistrate Meng

19:39.120 --> 19:40.160
for handling it so brilliantly!

19:40.240 --> 19:41.840
So brilliantly!

19:41.920 --> 19:43.280
Magistrate Meng!

19:43.360 --> 19:45.400
Sir, the people's trust is crucial.

19:49.040 --> 19:49.880
Considering

19:49.960 --> 19:52.720
that Ms. Ji's urgency to save her mother

19:52.800 --> 19:53.840
and the circumstances,

19:53.920 --> 19:56.320
this court will not pursue the matter

19:56.400 --> 19:58.280
of giving false testimony.

19:58.880 --> 20:00.960
This case is hereby closed.

20:02.680 --> 20:03.920
The court is adjourned!

20:04.000 --> 20:06.280
- Great!
- Great!

20:44.840 --> 20:46.080
- Mother!
- Mother!

20:46.160 --> 20:47.200
Yingying!

20:47.280 --> 20:48.680
- Mother!
- Yaoting!

20:48.760 --> 20:49.680
Mother.

20:51.760 --> 20:52.600
Yingying.

20:59.920 --> 21:02.480
Mother. Let's go home.

21:05.040 --> 21:06.120
Let's go home.

21:22.680 --> 21:23.640
Yingying,

21:24.480 --> 21:27.040
while I was away,

21:28.320 --> 21:30.880
did anything else happen at home?

21:33.760 --> 21:35.400
I married into the Yang family.

21:36.040 --> 21:37.320
I married Yang Jinglan.

21:41.400 --> 21:44.000
Did you marry him to save me?

21:44.080 --> 21:45.560
No, Mother.

21:46.080 --> 21:47.760
It was my own decision to marry him.

21:48.720 --> 21:50.880
No. That can't be.

21:51.480 --> 21:53.000
You're lying to me.

21:54.080 --> 21:55.600
I was still in prison at the time.

21:55.680 --> 21:57.520
If it weren't absolutely necessary,

21:58.040 --> 21:59.480
who would marry at such a time?

22:05.440 --> 22:06.520
Yingying,

22:06.600 --> 22:08.040
I'm sorry.

22:08.640 --> 22:10.080
It's my fault for dragging you down.

22:10.160 --> 22:12.720
Mother, don't say that.

22:13.640 --> 22:15.440
Although marrying into the Yang family

22:16.160 --> 22:17.320
was a matter of necessity,

22:18.400 --> 22:20.560
I've long admired Yang Jinglan.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.920
Though it was by chance,

22:23.480 --> 22:25.280
I am willing.

22:26.720 --> 22:27.560
Really?

22:28.440 --> 22:29.600
Yes.

22:34.120 --> 22:35.240
Before,

22:35.880 --> 22:38.360
I only wanted to keep you away
from trouble.

22:38.440 --> 22:41.600
At that time, Yang Jinglan
was also burdened with problems.

22:42.120 --> 22:44.480
I truly didn't want
to marry you off to him.

22:46.400 --> 22:47.760
But who could have guessed

22:48.280 --> 22:49.800
fate had its way,

22:49.880 --> 22:51.760
and you still married him?

22:51.840 --> 22:55.160
Did Yang Jinglan
want to marry me from the start?

22:55.240 --> 22:59.280
Silly child,
can't you see his feelings for you?

22:59.360 --> 23:00.840
Has he not treated you well?

23:01.560 --> 23:03.600
He treats me very well.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.560
He always has.

23:06.000 --> 23:06.840
It's just

23:06.920 --> 23:09.600
that we've always referred
to each other as allies,

23:09.680 --> 23:11.360
never expressing our true feelings.

23:13.000 --> 23:15.280
I had planned to ask him directly

23:15.360 --> 23:16.560
when he returned.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.280
A few days ago,

23:20.360 --> 23:23.520
despite traveling great distances
and being covered in injuries,

23:23.600 --> 23:25.600
he still rushed back to protect me

23:25.680 --> 23:27.000
and marry me.

23:27.680 --> 23:29.680
How could I not understand his feelings?

23:32.160 --> 23:35.560
But perhaps this marriage
happened too suddenly

23:36.080 --> 23:37.920
and was mixed with too many other things,

23:38.600 --> 23:40.720
I can't face him

23:40.800 --> 23:42.920
like a proper bride should.

23:44.240 --> 23:45.840
The questions I want to ask

23:46.360 --> 23:47.840
and the feelings I want to share

23:47.920 --> 23:49.720
have become so hard to put into words.

23:52.320 --> 23:54.320
I'm happy for you.

23:56.440 --> 23:58.880
There's no rush. No rush at all.

23:59.560 --> 24:02.480
As long as your hearts are connected,

24:02.560 --> 24:04.040
I believe some words

24:04.560 --> 24:06.440
can still be understood,

24:06.520 --> 24:08.000
even if they're left unsaid.

24:10.800 --> 24:13.440
He and I have a lifetime ahead of us.

24:18.800 --> 24:20.640
Mother, it's time for your medicine.

24:33.000 --> 24:34.200
Mother,

24:34.280 --> 24:36.400
once you've recovered,

24:36.920 --> 24:38.240
we'll leave Yizhou

24:38.320 --> 24:39.880
and move to Jiangnan.

24:40.400 --> 24:43.000
We'll live a peaceful life as a family.

24:43.520 --> 24:44.880
You and Yaoting go first.

24:44.960 --> 24:47.280
I'll join you after I settle things here.

24:53.640 --> 24:55.720
If you come with us to Jiangnan,

24:55.800 --> 24:57.480
what about Yang Jinglan?

24:57.560 --> 24:58.800
What about the Yang family?

24:59.840 --> 25:02.640
The Yang family's business
will expand to Jiangnan too.

25:02.720 --> 25:04.800
I'll manage it then.

25:05.320 --> 25:07.960
And after this year,
Yang Jinglan can transfer his post.

25:08.040 --> 25:09.440
He'll come with me.

25:10.040 --> 25:11.000
Yingying,

25:11.640 --> 25:13.360
are you lying to me again?

25:14.320 --> 25:15.280
I know

25:15.360 --> 25:18.000
you just want to send me somewhere safe

25:18.080 --> 25:19.400
so you can go on taking risks yourself.

25:20.600 --> 25:22.440
Even if we do go to Jiangnan,

25:22.520 --> 25:24.720
you won't easily give up.

25:24.800 --> 25:27.600
You still want to fight for an outcome.

25:29.640 --> 25:31.760
Mother, I've made up my mind.

25:32.280 --> 25:33.360
I won't fight anymore.

25:33.440 --> 25:35.640
All I want is for you to be safe.

25:39.640 --> 25:40.480
Madam,

25:41.800 --> 25:43.040
Yang Jinglan is here.

25:43.120 --> 25:44.960
He said
he came to greet his mother-in-law.

25:45.960 --> 25:46.960
Why is he here?

25:47.640 --> 25:49.360
- Yingying.
- Yingying.

25:50.000 --> 25:51.480
- Compose yourself.
- Compose yourself.

25:54.760 --> 25:55.600
He's injured.

25:55.680 --> 25:56.760
He shouldn't be moving around recklessly.

25:56.840 --> 25:58.800
I'll go meet him first.

25:58.880 --> 26:02.040
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

26:13.720 --> 26:17.080
Do you know
what Yingying's favorite food is?

26:21.480 --> 26:22.320
I don't know.

26:24.840 --> 26:26.800
And what food does she hate the most?

26:29.240 --> 26:30.080
I don't know.

26:33.520 --> 26:35.240
What does she love to play with?

26:35.320 --> 26:37.920
When she's upset,
what does she like to do the most?

26:48.800 --> 26:49.640
I don't know.

26:53.520 --> 26:54.520
Yaoting!

26:56.440 --> 26:57.640
Look at you.

26:58.400 --> 27:00.400
It's only been a day,
and you already miss him.

27:01.160 --> 27:02.520
I don't miss him.

27:02.600 --> 27:03.920
I'm just worried about his health.

27:04.840 --> 27:06.400
That's still missing him.

27:07.600 --> 27:08.440
Don't worry.

27:08.520 --> 27:10.320
Your brother knows his limits.

27:10.400 --> 27:11.520
Come,

27:12.640 --> 27:13.480
sit here.

27:17.520 --> 27:18.400
Yingying,

27:19.280 --> 27:20.880
the Yang family is a prominent household.

27:20.960 --> 27:22.520
There must be many rules.

27:23.400 --> 27:25.080
Now that you're married,

27:25.160 --> 27:27.040
try to manage your temper.

27:27.760 --> 27:30.720
Don't act like you're still at home,
causing chaos all day.

27:30.800 --> 27:32.200
No, I didn't!

27:34.880 --> 27:35.720
Here,

27:35.800 --> 27:37.400
take this.

27:37.920 --> 27:39.520
If you find it hard to bear,

27:39.600 --> 27:40.800
just fiddle with these prayer beads

27:40.880 --> 27:42.560
and think about my advice.

27:43.240 --> 27:44.760
If you really can't bear it,

27:44.840 --> 27:46.560
don't wrong yourself either.

27:47.080 --> 27:48.040
All right.

27:48.120 --> 27:50.280
Let me help you put it on.

27:53.240 --> 27:54.320
Thank you, Mother.

27:56.080 --> 27:58.240
So, what do you truly understand?

28:02.800 --> 28:05.240
I know that since I've married her,

28:06.160 --> 28:07.960
I must be her support,

28:08.480 --> 28:10.680
so she won't face the hardships alone.

28:14.200 --> 28:15.600
You and she are like-minded,

28:15.680 --> 28:17.360
with hearts that resonate.

28:18.120 --> 28:20.320
But marriage is more than just that.

28:20.920 --> 28:22.280
For a husband and wife,

28:22.360 --> 28:23.560
the various household affairs
of daily life

28:23.640 --> 28:25.400
can wear down feelings

28:25.480 --> 28:27.680
just as much as external hardships.

28:28.680 --> 28:31.120
And Yingying is no ordinary woman.

28:31.200 --> 28:32.560
Perhaps,

28:34.640 --> 28:36.040
it will be even harder for her to adjust.

28:40.840 --> 28:41.880
That's true,

28:44.520 --> 28:45.760
but where she belongs

28:45.840 --> 28:47.480
is by my side,

28:48.040 --> 28:49.840
not with the prominent Yang family.

28:50.760 --> 28:52.480
Once she fulfills her obligations
to the Yang family,

28:52.560 --> 28:53.760
we'll move out.

28:54.560 --> 28:55.720
Through every meal and every night,

28:56.600 --> 28:57.840
through every season,

28:58.480 --> 28:59.720
I'll be with her,

28:59.800 --> 29:00.640
love her,

29:00.720 --> 29:02.080
understand her,

29:02.160 --> 29:03.320
and respect her.

29:04.320 --> 29:06.080
Even though she's now my wife,

29:06.600 --> 29:07.680
Ji Yingying

29:07.760 --> 29:09.080
is still herself first

29:09.160 --> 29:11.160
before she is my wife.

29:41.920 --> 29:43.200
Yang Jinglan,

29:43.280 --> 29:44.240
who allowed you to come out?

29:54.800 --> 29:56.400
TO MS. YANG
I AM DR. ZHANG. BASED ON MY EVALUATION

29:56.480 --> 29:58.560
MR. YANG'S CONDITION
ALLOWS HIM TO TRAVEL BY CARRIAGE

30:01.120 --> 30:03.720
Did you force him to write this?

30:05.040 --> 30:06.520
In your eyes,

30:06.600 --> 30:08.240
am I truly so unrefined?

30:11.320 --> 30:12.880
Come on. Help me up.

30:19.520 --> 30:20.920
What are you trying to do? Don't move.

30:21.880 --> 30:23.000
It's my first time visiting.

30:23.080 --> 30:24.880
I must pay my respects
to my mother-in-law.

30:31.040 --> 30:32.000
Come on, Yingying.

30:32.960 --> 30:33.800
Help me up.

30:34.440 --> 30:35.560
But you…

30:37.600 --> 30:38.440
Please, I'm begging you.

30:44.760 --> 30:47.080
- Take care.
- As you wish.

31:03.720 --> 31:05.040
Guo Kui,

31:05.120 --> 31:06.440
look at me.

31:06.520 --> 31:09.040
I've finally entered
through the front door

31:09.560 --> 31:11.080
with proper dignity.

31:11.160 --> 31:12.280
Shut up.

31:14.280 --> 31:15.480
Mother.

31:18.800 --> 31:20.480
Mr. Yang, you're still injured.

31:20.560 --> 31:21.600
No need for formalities.

31:22.200 --> 31:23.280
Etiquette cannot be abandoned.

31:29.160 --> 31:31.600
I hereby pay my respects to you.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.360
The marriage was rushed,

31:40.440 --> 31:42.160
and I couldn't inform you in time.

31:42.240 --> 31:43.960
Please forgive me.

31:49.560 --> 31:51.640
Good child, get up.

31:56.840 --> 31:59.720
Before, I was so worried
about Yingying's safety

31:59.800 --> 32:02.080
that I nearly ruined your union.

32:02.720 --> 32:04.760
Now that you're finally together,

32:04.840 --> 32:06.240
I've come to understand.

32:06.840 --> 32:09.320
From now on,
our family will stand together

32:09.400 --> 32:10.520
through thick and thin.

32:12.640 --> 32:13.480
I entrust our Yingying

32:15.040 --> 32:16.480
to your care.

32:23.200 --> 32:24.280
Please don't worry.

32:25.000 --> 32:26.720
As long as I'm by Yingying's side,

32:27.240 --> 32:28.640
I'll protect her

32:30.080 --> 32:31.200
until she…

32:32.840 --> 32:33.680
No,

32:34.520 --> 32:36.720
until I give my last breath.

32:45.640 --> 32:48.360
The Crown Prince sends congratulations
to the Ji family!

33:05.360 --> 33:06.440
Mrs. Ji,

33:07.200 --> 33:08.560
His Highness congratulates

33:08.640 --> 33:10.360
Inspector Yang and Ms. Ji
on their joyous union

33:11.080 --> 33:13.680
and sends these gifts
to celebrate the occasion.

33:27.040 --> 33:30.840
The entire Ji family bows in gratitude
for His Highness's generosity.

33:39.400 --> 33:40.400
Please, rise.

33:52.240 --> 33:53.600
This is a gift

33:54.240 --> 33:55.440
that my senior prepared for me.

33:55.960 --> 33:58.000
Please accept it, Mrs. Ji.

33:59.240 --> 34:01.280
The Crown Prince
has prepared so much already.

34:02.800 --> 34:03.920
Your husband

34:04.000 --> 34:05.600
is using the Crown Prince's name

34:05.680 --> 34:07.160
to make up your betrothal gifts.

34:08.560 --> 34:09.440
Now, let's see

34:09.520 --> 34:12.560
who dares say your marriage
isn't proper anymore!

34:16.360 --> 34:17.960
Though I stole you as my wife,

34:18.639 --> 34:20.280
what other wives have,

34:20.360 --> 34:22.600
my wife will have as well.

34:24.080 --> 34:25.639
I'll make sure you get

34:25.719 --> 34:27.360
everything you deserve.

34:47.880 --> 34:48.880
Slow down.

34:50.920 --> 34:51.800
Here.

35:50.640 --> 35:51.920
They're still so careless.

36:29.920 --> 36:31.160
My mother and brother insisted

36:31.240 --> 36:32.800
that I bring these small items.

36:32.880 --> 36:35.000
They're just everyday things I use.

36:35.080 --> 36:36.760
They're afraid
I'm not used to the Yang family.

36:40.560 --> 36:43.240
If you ever need anything else,
just let me know.

36:43.920 --> 36:45.160
I'll have someone get it for you.

37:02.200 --> 37:03.240
I don't need it.

37:06.200 --> 37:07.560
Could you go slower?

37:14.160 --> 37:15.120
Yang Jinglan.

37:15.760 --> 37:16.920
Fine.

37:32.000 --> 37:33.400
Why are you staring at me?

37:34.240 --> 37:35.480
Because you're beautiful.

38:02.120 --> 38:03.960
Yang Jinglan, can you say something?

38:04.480 --> 38:05.920
It's too quiet.

38:07.880 --> 38:08.720
All right.

38:09.840 --> 38:11.240
Why don't you ask me

38:11.960 --> 38:12.920
about me and the Crown Prince?

38:14.400 --> 38:15.440
Fine!

38:16.640 --> 38:18.160
You're an inspector

38:18.240 --> 38:19.880
and carry the Crown Prince's orders.

38:19.960 --> 38:21.280
So, you're one of his men?

38:22.840 --> 38:24.160
More or less.

38:24.240 --> 38:26.360
What do you mean by "more or less"?

38:35.040 --> 38:37.120
You dare to eat my chicken?

38:38.880 --> 38:41.280
That'll be 500 taels. Cash only.

38:42.560 --> 38:43.800
A guest is always welcome.

38:43.880 --> 38:44.920
Don't be so stingy.

38:47.680 --> 38:49.320
Aren't you curious

38:49.880 --> 38:50.760
about who I am?

38:52.760 --> 38:55.680
Looking at your attire,
you're either rich or noble.

38:55.760 --> 38:58.600
No ordinary person would come
to such a godforsaken place.

38:59.120 --> 39:01.200
You must be following orders
from that old man.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.280
Do you know

39:02.360 --> 39:04.120
that the old man you speak of

39:04.640 --> 39:06.680
was once the Crown Prince's tutor?

39:06.760 --> 39:08.000
I didn't know before.

39:08.080 --> 39:09.240
Now I do.

39:10.120 --> 39:12.400
Turns out I'm not the only person
that the old man's messed with.

39:13.480 --> 39:14.880
If you lie with coal, you get blackened.

39:14.960 --> 39:16.640
The Crown Prince
must be terribly crooked, then.

39:17.560 --> 39:18.400
Who is it?

39:21.600 --> 39:22.720
Greetings, sir.

39:23.920 --> 39:25.040
He's your teacher?

39:25.560 --> 39:27.800
Old man,
how many students have you taken in?

39:27.880 --> 39:30.800
In my entire life,
I've only taken you two as disciples.

39:30.880 --> 39:32.200
Especially you, little rascal,

39:32.280 --> 39:33.560
you've been more than enough for me
to handle.

39:33.640 --> 39:35.360
How could I possibly have the energy
for anyone else?

39:36.120 --> 39:37.920
So, he is…

39:38.000 --> 39:39.000
the Crown Prince?

39:40.120 --> 39:41.240
Call him Senior Brother.

39:45.520 --> 39:47.440
THE CROWN PRINCE

39:57.360 --> 39:58.840
The old man is dead.

39:58.920 --> 40:00.640
I cannot let this grudge go unanswered.

40:02.080 --> 40:03.600
Please, Your Highness, grant me this.

40:08.360 --> 40:09.240
Rise.

40:09.760 --> 40:12.320
Do you think I haven't thought
of avenging our teacher?

40:13.480 --> 40:14.960
If it weren't for my pleas,

40:15.560 --> 40:17.160
he wouldn't have met this end.

40:18.840 --> 40:20.040
But now,

40:20.120 --> 40:21.760
the court is in chaos.

40:21.840 --> 40:23.480
The Military Commissioner
is holding his own army.

40:24.640 --> 40:26.560
And Yizhou
is not even under my jurisdiction.

40:27.240 --> 40:28.520
Our teacher's death

40:29.240 --> 40:31.240
may be a warning to me.

40:32.720 --> 40:34.800
If Your Highness give me the chance,

40:36.000 --> 40:37.160
Yizhou

40:38.360 --> 40:40.160
can forever remain the Emperor's Yizhou.

40:41.680 --> 40:43.360
You want to help me break this deadlock?

40:45.080 --> 40:46.400
So,

40:46.480 --> 40:48.360
you're not only
the Crown Prince's subordinate

40:48.440 --> 40:49.760
but also his junior brother.

40:52.240 --> 40:55.120
And Yizhou's fate
is tied to the standing of Chang'an?

40:55.920 --> 40:57.000
That depends

40:57.520 --> 40:58.680
on what I can uncover.

40:59.680 --> 41:01.000
How do you plan to investigate?

41:01.760 --> 41:03.840
Niu Jin knows my identity now.

41:03.920 --> 41:06.480
He'll undoubtedly be more cautious
in the future.

41:06.560 --> 41:07.960
But his past deeds

41:08.040 --> 41:09.280
would leave traces.

41:10.240 --> 41:12.960
Now that he knows
I've looked into Nanzhao,

41:13.680 --> 41:14.520
he wouldn't dare

41:14.600 --> 41:17.120
to tamper with anyone tied to that line

41:17.200 --> 41:18.400
for fear of exposing himself.

41:19.120 --> 41:21.120
Niu Jin produces the Shu brocade,

41:21.760 --> 41:23.920
Nanzhao buys the Shu brocade,

41:24.000 --> 41:27.600
so who transports the brocade?

41:31.120 --> 41:33.520
From Yizhou to Nanzhao,

41:33.600 --> 41:34.600
there are numerous checkpoints.

41:35.360 --> 41:36.720
To avoid detection,

41:36.800 --> 41:38.000
one must disguise themselves.

41:39.560 --> 41:40.400
You want to investigate foreign merchants?

41:42.320 --> 41:43.160
You're smart!

41:45.720 --> 41:47.960
But with so many foreign merchants,
how will you narrow it down?

41:52.640 --> 41:53.640
I have someone in mind.

41:55.040 --> 41:56.240
I've thought of someone too.

41:57.000 --> 41:58.160
- Bai Sheng!
- Prince Bai of Nanzhao!

41:59.200 --> 42:00.040
Prince Bai?

42:03.840 --> 42:04.800
Sheng Fengze.

42:07.320 --> 42:09.680
Sheng Fengze…

42:12.520 --> 42:13.880
Bai Sheng…

42:15.640 --> 42:17.800
Could they be the same person?

42:20.240 --> 42:21.280
It's possible.

42:26.360 --> 42:27.600
But based on his age,

42:27.680 --> 42:29.400
he would have been just a child

42:29.480 --> 42:31.000
the year my father had his incident.

42:31.600 --> 42:32.840
That doesn't add up.

42:33.440 --> 42:36.320
However,
if he's only involved in smuggling,

42:37.080 --> 42:39.840
why would he personally travel
such great distances to Yizhou?

42:40.960 --> 42:42.360
And later, when he approached me,

42:42.960 --> 42:44.200
what was he after?
